{"id": "x001-003", "text": "Noah got made redundant from the logistics firm on Friday. He's putting a brave face on it but I think he's pretty shaken. His wife Ciara is pregnant with their second, due in early March, which makes the timing awful. He's going to try contracting for a while. Remind me to call him early next week and send him that recruiter's details.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant from the logistics firm", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "putting a brave face on it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty shaken", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ciara", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early March", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "going to try contracting", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "early next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him that recruiter's details", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "x001-009", "text": "Imogen invited us to her 40th at the end of the month. It's a garden party at her parents' place in Kent. She said absolutely no presents, but she did mention she's been wanting a decent pasta machine. Her husband Jack is organising a surprise slideshow and wants old photos by the 20th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Imogen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "40th", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wanting a decent pasta machine", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise slideshow", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the 20th", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "x001-015", "text": "Zainab said the engagement party on May 14 has been called off. She and Tariq split up a couple of weeks ago. She's heartbroken. She kept apologising for the hassle, which broke my heart. Her parents had already paid the deposit on the venue. I want to take her out for lunch sometime next week, just the two of us, and maybe suggest a weekend away later in the spring.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zainab", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 14"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tariq", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a couple of weeks ago", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "heartbroken", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take her out for lunch", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "suggest a weekend away", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "later in the spring", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "x001-022", "text": "Aneesh lives in Leeds now and works for the council. His wife Priya is a teacher.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aneesh", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives in Leeds", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "works for the council", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Priya", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "teacher", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "x001-023", "text": "Ciara's flight to Boston got moved to 6/18, so the farewell brunch is now June 15th instead.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ciara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flight to Boston", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "to 6/18", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "farewell brunch", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 15th", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "x001-024", "text": "Long chat with Ava tonight. Her brother Sam lost his job last month when the factory closed, and now their mum is ill too, so Ava is driving up to Glasgow most weekends. She's exhausted but says it's fine. She's still planning the trip to Lisbon in early April with Caitlin, which I think she really needs. I should offer to cover her shift on the 9th so she can get away a day early.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ava", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lost his job", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "ill", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ava", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving up to Glasgow", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "most weekends", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "trip to Lisbon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early April", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to cover her shift", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e4", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 9th", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "a day early", "anchor": "e4"}]}
{"id": "x001-029", "text": "Jada's birthday is August 9. She loves anything from that candle shop in Brighton.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "August 9", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "anything from that candle shop in Brighton", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "x001-030", "text": "Florin has a big family wedding in Bucharest on September 20th and is nervous about giving a speech in Romanian.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Florin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "big family wedding in Bucharest", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "September 20th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech in Romanian", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "x001-033", "text": "Jack and his partner are expecting! Due sometime in early March.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Due", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in early March", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "x001-036", "text": "Abebe's grandmother passed away in Addis two years ago. He still talks about her cooking.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abebe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandmother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away in Addis", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "two years ago", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "x001-037", "text": "Imogen said the trip to Peru is off because her knee surgery got moved to May 20. She's gutted. Remind me to send her something nice for recovery.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Imogen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee surgery", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "to May 20", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her something nice for recovery", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recovery", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "x001-039", "text": "Spoke with Mrs Nakamura next door. Her husband's funeral is on 11/2 at the church on Hill Road. Her son is flying over from Osaka on Thursday to help with everything, and her daughter arrives the day before the service. She seemed calm but kept losing her train of thought. I should go and maybe bring a casserole round the day after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Nakamura", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "next door", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "11/2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying over from Osaka", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "arrives", "owner": "r3", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before the service", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "calm", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "go", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bring a casserole round", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "x001-045", "text": "Björn and his wife have just split after twenty years. He's taking it very hard. Text him this weekend, and maybe invite him to the barbecue on July 4th. Their daughter Ava is starting uni in September, so he's dreading the house being empty. He said he might go walking in Norway over the summer to clear his head.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Björn", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "taking it very hard", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "invite him to the barbecue", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "barbecue", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "July 4th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ava", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "uni", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading the house being empty", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "walking in Norway", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e4"}]}
{"id": "x001-049", "text": "Tamar texted. The meeting went fine and she kept her job. Over the moon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tamar", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "meeting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Over the moon", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
